firstWeek:
  - task: Get water turned on
    who: Left Hand Water District
    body: Drinking water in Niwot comes from the district, not from a city utility. Service, rates and meters are theirs.
    href: https://lefthandwater.gov/
  - task: Find out about sewer
    who: Niwot Sanitation District
    body: The district serves the addresses its lines reach. Whether yours is one of them depends on the address, so ask before assuming either way.
    href: https://niwotsd.colorado.gov/
  - task: Enrol at school
    who: St. Vrain Valley Schools
    body: Enrolment, catchment boundaries and transportation are the district's. There is no Niwot school district — the county's boundaries decide which school an address is in.
    href: https://www.svvsd.org/
  - task: Know who answers a 911 call
    who: Mountain View Fire Rescue
    body: Fire suppression, rescue and emergency medical response come from the fire district. Law enforcement in unincorporated Boulder County is the Sheriff's Office.
    href: https://www.mvfpd.org/
  - task: Register to vote
    who: Boulder County Elections
    body: Registration, ballots and drop-off locations are handled by the county clerk. Colorado runs mail-ballot elections, so an accurate address matters.
    href: https://bouldercounty.gov/elections/
  - task: Check before you build
    who: Boulder County Building Division
    body: Permits and inspections are the county's, and so is zoning and development review. There is no town planning office to ask instead.
