<p class="n-small" style="margin:18px 0 0;max-width:72ch">There is no town refuse service, because there is no town: trash, recycling and the utilities other than water are the household&#8217;s own arrangement.</p>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:10px 0 0;max-width:72ch">If your street is one this guide has something specific and sourced about, <a class="n-link" href="/contact/">tell us</a> and it goes in.</p>
