<div class="n-label">The year, if you live here</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Concerts on the park lawn on summer Thursdays, dancing on the square on Fridays, an art walk on second Fridays, a Halloween party on Second Avenue, a tree lighting and a parade over Thanksgiving weekend. Most of it is free and all of it is run by neighbors.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/annual-events/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">The annual programme <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
<div class="n-callout n-callout--paper" style="background:var(--n-white)">
<div class="n-label">The everyday</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">An independent grocery with a deli and a sushi counter, two commercial blocks of kitchens and shops, the trades and the practices &#8212; and the LoBo trail if the commute can be done on a bike.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/eat-shop/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">The business directory <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
