<div class="n-label" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink)">November 3, 2026</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="vote-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:20ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">The vote on whether Niwot becomes a town</h2>
</div>
<div class="n-read">
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0">Registered electors living inside a proposed boundary decide, in a coordinated mail-ballot election, whether Niwot should incorporate as a municipality &#8212; and, on the same ballot, on the taxes and the first council that would follow if it does. It is the biggest thing on this page: it is a vote about whether the arrangement described above continues.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:18px 0 0">This site takes no position on it. Its election page summarises the ballot from the Election Commission&#8217;s own published text, says which body is responsible for what, dates every claim and publishes its corrections. The official text controls, and the Commission&#8217;s own site is linked from every measure.</p>
